      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The inability to height-scale to such a huge degree removes some of the most entertaining moments I've witnessed in VRChat, in an effort to avoid people trolling with something that (if done without malice) is just plain fun (and downright funny a lot of the time). \n\nI think this should be decided per-instance as well. Or maybe (for group instances) by those with group instance moderation permissions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
